<%= render layout: "topic", locals: {
  headline: "The Lightek Media newsroom.",
  intro: "Find company background and get in touch for interviews, partnership announcements, or media inquiries.",
  action: "Contact the newsroom", subject: "Lightek press inquiry",
  prompts: ["Name and outlet:", "Story or interview topic:", "Deadline and contact details:"]
} do %>
  <section>
    <h2>About Lightek Media</h2>
    <p>Lightek Media &amp; Communications Group is building a Black-led network that connects social communities to production, television distribution, and commerce. The company invites independent creators, stations, crew, agencies, and sponsors to build alongside its own productions.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>How the network grows</h2>
    <p>Creators can bring audiences and programming into the network. Stations can bring lineups and local markets. Agencies can help client businesses launch and grow. Each can open opportunities for the others.</p>
  </section>
  <% if @press_releases.present? %>
    <section>
      <h2>Press releases</h2>
      <ul>
        <% @press_releases.each do |entry| %>
          <li><%= link_to entry.post.title, website_blog_path(entry.slug) %>
            <time datetime="<%= entry.published_at.iso8601 %>"><%= l(entry.published_at.to_date, format: :long) %></time>
          </li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    </section>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
